  "description": "DEPRECATED - use GroupDocs.Conversion instead.\n\n      This package has been merged into GroupDocs.Conversion, which as of 26.8.0 ships\n      per-TFM runtime packages that are cross-platform on Windows, Linux, and macOS.\n      On net6.0 it resolves GroupDocs.Conversion.Net60, which carries the same\n      GroupDocs.CrossPlatform.NativeAssets and SkiaSharp native assets this package did.\n      Replace the reference with GroupDocs.Conversion - the assembly name, namespaces and\n      public API are unchanged, and Microsoft Publisher (.pub) support, which used to be\n      exclusive to this package, is now in the mainline build.\n\n      Note that this package stopped at 24.12.0 while the replacement is at 26.8.0, so\n      migrating also means taking two years of ordinary API changes - most visibly the\n      PageSize members and some Converter constructor overloads. Review the release notes\n      for the versions in between.\n\n      This version contains no assemblies. It only forwards to GroupDocs.Conversion.",
